This is exposed by #102409 (comment). I checked the memory leak in the linked comment is resolved if SavedVariables are correctly constructed with a tensor and is_output=true. It however seems to expose another problem as you can see in https://hud.pytorch.org/pr/pytorch/pytorch/105368#15142012171:
